# 白名单式：默认排除所有内容，只放行进镜像需要的文件。
# 与服务端运行无关的桌面端、文档、构建产物都不进入构建上下文。
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/
!apps/server/
!apps/server/package.json
!apps/server/prisma/
!apps/server/prisma/**
!apps/server/src/
!apps/server/src/**
!apps/shared/
!apps/shared/package.json
!apps/shared/validate.js
!apps/shared/schema/
!apps/shared/schema/**
!data/
!data/*.json
# 本地 mock 预览文件绝不进镜像（保留在仓库里给本地开发用）
data/*.local.json
